  "lines": {
    "Hi there, I'm Mira! So glad you stopped by. What brings you here today?": {
      "src": "/audio/mira/ab3f8b0ee304.wav",
      "seconds": 4.47
    },
    "Hey, you're back! It's me, Mira. I was hoping you'd come say hi again. What can I help with today?": {
      "src": "/audio/mira/e3bc84026997.wav",
      "seconds": 5.88
    },
    "We build websites, web systems and mobile apps, and make sure they look and feel lovely too. Want to start dreaming up yours?": {
      "src": "/audio/mira/587667e5263f.wav",
      "seconds": 7.5
    },
    "Of course! Wander around as long as you like. If an idea sparks, just give me a shout. I'll be right here!": {
      "src": "/audio/mira/b590bcd4e16d.wav",
      "seconds": 6.33
    },
    "Yay, this is my favourite part! Let's get started.": {
      "src": "/audio/mira/e4676395f9ad.wav",
      "seconds": 3.45
    },
    "First things first, what can I help you build?": {
      "src": "/audio/mira/9f4d18d3c109.wav",
      "seconds": 3
    },
    "So, where's the project at right now?": {
